description: Never use em dashes in copy, comments, or UI text.
alwaysApply: true
---

# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (Unicode U+2014), `&mdash;`, or `&#8212;`.

Use a colon, comma, period, or a spaced hyphen (` - `) instead.

Examples:
- Title: `AegisOps AI: Digital Hospital Command Center`
- Prose: `Decision support only - not a diagnostic system.`
